@startuml defect-lifecycle
!include _style.iuml
skinparam linetype polyline
hide empty description
left to right direction

[*] --> New : test fails
New --> Assigned : triaged\n(severity, priority)
Assigned --> Fixed : code change\ncommitted
Fixed --> Retest
Retest --> Closed : test passes and\nfull suite green
Retest --> Reopened : still failing
Reopened --> Assigned
Closed --> [*]
@enduml
